    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55661" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταψάλλω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>play stringed instruments to</i>, [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συμπόσιον] καταυλεῖν καὶ κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.713e
				</span></i>
			:—usu. in 
				Pass.
			, <i>have music played to one, enjoy music</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				785e
			</span></i>; of places, <i>resound with music</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				56
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be buried to the sound of music</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procop.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				2.23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταψάλλεται . . ὁ δημιουργός</span>
			<i>is drummed out</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Chr.</u>
				34
			</span></i>.</div>
